Confirm the catalog event's integration and description before saving it. Event matching is provider-specific.

`include_event` defaults to `true`. With it on, Agenta adds the event to the last user message: a line `Event data (<event type>):`, then the event's `attributes` as a JSON block. Set it to `false` to send the message alone. Each delivery records the event it received in `data.event`.

